00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.900
SAMAN JAVAN: If you're using
popular data processing tools

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:53.290
like Hadoop and Spark, you're
probably spending more time

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:56.500
